ssh -i keyfile user@host -p PORT (“Log in using a private key instead of a password.”)

-i sshkey.private → “use this identity (key) file”

chmod 600 → “make the key private enough for SSH to accept it”

-p 2220 → “connect to the correct SSH port for Bandit”
